No -fexceptions.

configure appends -fexceptions (JS exceptions for emcc), which emcc refuses
next to -sSUPPORT_LONGJMP=wasm: every later check would fail (sizeof(long
double) = 0, hence long double = double and wrong doubles).  libffi is C,
it needs none.

--- a/configure
+++ b/configure
@@
 if test "x$GCC" = "xyes"; then
-  CFLAGS="$CFLAGS -fexceptions"
+  : # ocaml-emcc: no -fexceptions
